WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:05.800
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:06.940 --> 00:00:10.800
<i>We'll stay in the Geduld till we reach the</i>
<i>closest point to Hyperion, then head there.</i>

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.230
- <i>What are you saying?</i>
- <i>What about the Ryvius?</i>

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.310
<i>You're not!</i>

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:15.510
<i>You're not planning to</i>
<i>abandon them, are you?</i>

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.650
<i>And if I am, what'll you do about it?</i>

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.670
<i>We're safe as long as</i>
<i>we're in the Lift ship.</i>

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.750
<i>The Ryvius and its garbage</i>
<i>people are no longer necessary.</i>

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.120
- What's this supposed to mean?
- Isn't that the voice of that Blue fellow?

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.890
Who does he think he is?

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.360
Does he plan to abandon us?

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:40.260
I hope you guys know what's gonna
happen, treating us like this!

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.200
Treating you like what?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.270
You're the ones treating
people like what you say!

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:46.800
We heard everything!

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:49.040
You referred to us as garbage.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.080
You bastards!

00:00:51.510 --> 00:00:53.500
W-Wait, guys. Let me explain!

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:03.320
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:10.800
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.800
Although loneliness...

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:19.140
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:26.380
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:31.450
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:34.420
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:41.950
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:45.730
...the dream and the reality...

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:49.360
...that you saw cross paths

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:53.060
Some light is shed...

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:57.650
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:04.880
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:12.890
The things I want have no shape

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:21.300
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.520
Deforming World

00:02:43.190 --> 00:02:45.450
The conversation from the Lift
ship was aired throughout the ship?

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.360
Who'd do such a thing?

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:50.560
The problem is not who leaked it,
but the contents of the broadcast.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.230
I checked the broadcast records...

00:02:53.800 --> 00:02:56.530
...and according to them, it's clear
that Airs Blue tried to betray us.

00:02:56.970 --> 00:02:58.440
His actions are unforgivable.

00:02:58.770 --> 00:03:00.670
But the guilty person is right here!

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:03.970
The cowardly one who took action
to encourage them to riot!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.340
You should be glad that they're gone.

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.110
But I didn't do it.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:11.940
You were annoyed with
them yourself, Kouji.

00:03:12.520 --> 00:03:14.380
You seemed to get along
very well with Michelle!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.460
She approached me,
so I kept her company.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.560
Besides, Blue was around. I volunteered!

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.230
Otherwise, why should I
care for that delinquent?

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:25.600
I can't believe it.

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:28.300
You didn't say a word yourself
when it all happened.

00:03:28.800 --> 00:03:30.240
Don't try to be Mr. Goodguy now.

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.570
That's true, but...!

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:34.540
They won't be killed or anything.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:37.510
They'll just have to repay their debt
for doing as they wish all this time.

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:40.070
But they were with us
until only moments ago.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.590
Think about this calmly.

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:50.480
The Ryvius cannot be
navigated without us Zwei.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:55.230
I admit what happened here
does have its problems...

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:58.030
...but I confidently say it's the
best thing that could've happened.

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.670
I agree.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.130
It's for everyone's good.

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:02.800
But...!

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:05.530
Otherwise, this reform
wouldn't have happened.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:10.000
We must part with our past in
order to move forward, Kouji.

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:17.910
Part with our past?
How can you say that so easily?

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.220
Criff!

00:04:26.960 --> 00:04:28.690
Charlie? Why!

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:36.290
Would you have been able to acknowledge
the situation and change it yourself?

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:42.170
Criticizing without doing anything
yourself is a much more cowardly move.

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:44.870
<i>But is this really okay?</i>

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.010
<i>For me to remain here, remain as is?</i>

00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.260
The Ryvius says they've
gotten all of Blue's team!

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:58.220
The only one left is Blue himself,
currently on the Lift ship!

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.420
The route to Lift should
open any time now.

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.930
Anyone with an open hand,
move over to the other side!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:04.330
Hurry! We haven't got time!

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:05.470
We'll beat him up real good!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:06.700
- Blue, that bastard!
- How was it?

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:10.640
I'm still not completely sure, but they're
all excited about a revolution or something.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.240
Could Kouji and Faina be caught?

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:15.540
For what?

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.410
Because, if everyone's discontent,
they may take it out on...!

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.280
Even the Vital Guarder could be...!

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.210
Ikumi hasn't done anything wrong!

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:27.480
All he did was fight for me.
That's all.

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:32.890
We're telling him,
we'll overlook what happened.

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:34.660
It's okay as long as we don't
say a word about it, right?

00:05:35.130 --> 00:05:37.720
Please. Don't make things any
worse than they already are!

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:41.270
- Don't give me orders!
- But...!

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.010
What's this?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:53.740
That's the guy! The guy wearing
the bandana is the criminal!

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:55.020
Lucson?

00:05:55.020 --> 00:05:56.080
That guy?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.020
Wh-What's up with you guys?

00:05:58.350 --> 00:06:02.660
Shut up! We only wanna talk with
that bandana fellow over there!

00:06:02.660 --> 00:06:04.650
How dare you give up on us so easily!

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:06.460
How'd they know that?

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:08.860
The channel remained open.

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:11.990
We've captured all your guys on the ship.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.800
Supervisor, Airs Blue.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.570
We hereby restrain you for your role as...

00:06:17.570 --> 00:06:18.870
...leader of the group committing
tyranny on the Ryvius.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:22.310
Wait a minute. The actions
he was trying to take...!

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:24.830
What do you think you're doing?

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:29.180
- Please don't shoot!
- The guy's gotta gun!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.550
No one told me he has a gun!

00:06:39.190 --> 00:06:41.250
- Help! He's getting away!
- Get him!

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:44.530
Don't shoot!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:47.430
Airs Blue...!

00:06:50.070 --> 00:06:51.810
Don't go.
You'll end up getting involved.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.270
But...!

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:59.210
He'll be okay on his own.
If you go, you'd only be holding him back.

00:06:59.610 --> 00:07:00.780
I would?

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.010
You're not as clever as you seem.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:04.580
Damn Blue. Serves him right.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.110
It's called retribution.

00:07:08.790 --> 00:07:10.450
Were you okay, Juli?

00:07:10.720 --> 00:07:13.090
Everything's gonna be all right,
now that I'm here.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:18.760
He's had his own way with us
all this time, yet I... I...!

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.020
It must've been really painful.

00:07:21.340 --> 00:07:23.530
- What a fool.
- Juli!

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.530
Pat!

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:33.480
I feel so foolish. I only realized now.

00:07:34.150 --> 00:07:35.650
Really, how foolish of me.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:36.780
Juli...!

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:39.710
I think she needs to be left alone.

00:07:40.590 --> 00:07:44.050
Right. I almost forgot
to thank you. Thanks!

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:49.190
We were able to expel the oppressors
with the cooperation of your brother.

00:07:50.000 --> 00:07:54.330
I'm sure it was due to your brother's good
work the recording was aired for all to hear.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.660
M-My brother did what?

00:07:57.600 --> 00:08:00.770
That opportunist has done it again!
That piece of crap!

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.370
I'm the one who's supposed to beat Blue.

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.900
Do you really believe Kouji could
pull something like this off?

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.910
- Someone on the bridge did this.
- Who?

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.820
How should I know?

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:13.810
But now, we've once again been thrown
into an unavoidable situation.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:16.750
Things are gonna get rough on the ship.

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.350
What's happening?

00:08:19.990 --> 00:08:21.930
Those fools can fuss all they want.
What do I care?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.960
It's not that simple.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:27.030
There's Ikumi! He's okay!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.400
Yuki!

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.460
Ikumi!

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:34.470
Kouji's great at dealing with trouble,
but not with disputes.

00:08:35.040 --> 00:08:36.870
Protect Aoi in his place.

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:39.950
Aoi?

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:41.180
Damn you.

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:43.120
That's why you came here
in the first place, right?

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.620
No!

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.420
If she means that much
to you, protect her!

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:50.790
Ikumi, are you all right?

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:52.960
More or less.

00:08:52.960 --> 00:08:56.730
Do what you must. Otherwise, you'll
regret it for the rest of your life.

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.470
What is it with him?
He could at least say "hi".

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.140
Don't get so upset.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:06.260
What about Kouji?
How are things on the bridge?

00:09:06.470 --> 00:09:07.770
Yeah, they seem to be okay.

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:09.970
Are you relieved, Aoi?

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:13.040
It's not as if I was worried or anything.

00:09:13.550 --> 00:09:17.040
<i>Battle. Kouji. Blue. Aoi.</i>

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.850
<i>My mind's all messed up.</i>
<i>I can't get anything straight. Damn!</i>

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:44.010
Damn it!

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.850
The commotion was as if the people
were possessed by something.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:52.120
The number of casualties on the Ryvius
during the battle at Saturn was zero.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:58.320
But five people, Fu Namuchai, Ryu Gil,
Criff Cay, Michelle Cay, and Charlie...

00:09:58.930 --> 00:10:01.830
...have been restrained, due to the strong
desire expressed by the students.

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:05.190
Blue is still hiding within the ship.

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:08.060
This is the reality on the Ryvius.

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.290
This is our present.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.300
This is...!

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.010
Infinite Ryvius

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.890
Infinite Ryvius

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:51.500
Everyone, thank you for holding the
fort while I was away for so long.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:55.340
But there's no longer reason to worry.
I will take full responsibility...

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.780
...in the navigational
operations of the Ryvius...!

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:58.990
Wh-What are you doing?

00:10:58.990 --> 00:11:00.420
You're no longer needed here.

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:02.060
You'll only add to the confusion.

00:11:02.060 --> 00:11:03.820
Wh-What do you mean?

00:11:03.820 --> 00:11:05.190
Who do you think I am?

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.930
I'm the third son of the
24th generation Houjou Clan...!

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.320
We don't need anyone
who's always complaining!

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.440
W-Why is this?

00:11:17.140 --> 00:11:20.270
I'm the third son of the
24th generation Houjou Clan...

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:22.440
...and Zwei's training leader!

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.010
Oops.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.570
Pat! You mustn't run in the bathroom!

00:11:28.150 --> 00:11:30.140
Hey, hey. How's that girl doing?

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:34.280
It's the same no matter how often you
come to check. She's still asleep.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:39.750
We can't undress her, and without her ID,
we can't take her to the first aid room.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:44.220
She's bound to wake up
sometime. But in any case...!

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:45.790
What a strange looking outfit.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:48.030
What's wrong? That's what's great.

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.930
You're too young to be
attracted to such things.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.960
That's not it, funny face!

00:11:53.340 --> 00:11:55.810
What did you call me?
Wanna fight, little brat?

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:59.040
Keep it down, Nicks. I can't sleep.

00:11:59.350 --> 00:12:01.750
- Quiet.
- Why should I care about Kouji?

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:03.720
What do you mean by that?

00:12:03.920 --> 00:12:05.180
Sorry, Kouji.

00:12:05.650 --> 00:12:09.190
You're acting snobbish,
just because you work on the bridge.

00:12:09.190 --> 00:12:10.050
Nicks!

00:12:11.360 --> 00:12:14.990
Kouji. You're still here?
Don't you have to go to work?

00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:20.230
I've been forced against my will till now,
I think I deserve a little rest.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.300
So you were forced?

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.290
Sure was.
Otherwise, who'd wanna go there?

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:27.430
You went 'cause Faina's there, right?

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.010
Nicks!

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:30.540
Stop making fun!

00:12:30.540 --> 00:12:31.940
What happened on the bridge?

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.540
- Nothing...!
- You're lying!

00:12:35.280 --> 00:12:37.410
Stop it.
I don't wanna remember.

00:12:38.180 --> 00:12:39.810
Hey, are you sure you're all right?

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.150
Come on, wait a minute.

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.030
Know her?

00:12:47.030 --> 00:12:48.020
Another girl.

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:50.800
No, nothing like that.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.390
I-I've seen her around
a number of times.

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:56.930
Ah, I'm Nicks.
What section are you with?

00:12:57.470 --> 00:12:58.940
If you don't mind,
can you tell me your name?

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.370
You're being rude, all of a sudden.

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.830
I don't know...!

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:09.320
Hey, tell me! Hey! Hey!

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:11.350
- I'm talking to you! Hey! Hey!
- Nicks!

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:13.510
I'm so sorry! He doesn't mean any harm!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.510
Will she be okay?

00:13:17.660 --> 00:13:19.060
Don't you find her kinda spooky?

00:13:19.490 --> 00:13:21.790
That shyness is one of her good features.

00:13:22.000 --> 00:13:23.860
And this guy's a fool.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:06.070
Airs Blue.

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:06.940
Juli!

00:14:08.110 --> 00:14:10.980
So here you are.
You'd better hurry to the bridge.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.280
What's the matter?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.340
You've been elected our new captain.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.650
Huh?

00:14:15.650 --> 00:14:19.850
All Zwei members agree and most of
the students approve the decision.

00:14:20.320 --> 00:14:22.020
But no one asked me!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.650
B-But it's already been
decided by majority vote.

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:29.550
That's impossible. I can't possibly
lead everyone in this situation!

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.260
Please. Unless someone takes charge,
we're sure to face another person like Blue.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.100
Me as captain?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:42.740
You agree that we maintain
our present point system?

00:14:43.380 --> 00:14:44.410
Yes.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:45.840
What about patrol and supervision?

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.240
O-On a volunteer basis.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.550
Okay, I'll be in charge of that.

00:14:50.550 --> 00:14:54.540
Oh, and that unlimited
points status we have.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.920
I'd like to cancel that.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.190
What?

00:14:58.190 --> 00:14:59.160
Why?

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.950
Labeling us superior in any way will
only encourage distrust toward us.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.230
Everyone must be treated as equal.

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:10.170
We're navigating the Ryvius.
We've been working hard for everyone.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:12.010
It's an obvious right.

00:15:12.010 --> 00:15:15.500
We just won't say anything
to those ordinary people.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:17.640
But...!

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:19.240
They'll never know!

00:15:19.910 --> 00:15:23.440
But more importantly, we must
decide on the Ryvius's course.

00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.050
Well...!

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:30.450
I suggest taking a route
that will bypass Saturn.

00:15:31.190 --> 00:15:34.790
Our best chance is still to seek protection
from a self-governing territory.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:40.300
However, it's possible the enemy is
deliberately blocking our communication.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:45.440
Therefore, I suggest a method
of physically getting in touch...

00:15:45.910 --> 00:15:48.470
...by shooting probe
pods to each territory.

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:50.880
What do you think?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:53.710
R-Right. I think that would be good.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:55.810
But we'd be giving out our
location by doing that.

00:15:56.450 --> 00:15:57.940
All options come with some risk.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:01.110
It's better than wandering
about space forever.

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:02.860
Okay, that's fine with me.

00:16:03.690 --> 00:16:07.130
We'll get the ground crew section and
guys from level three to prepare the pods.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:09.930
I'll go and gather volunteers
to be supervisors.

00:16:11.100 --> 00:16:12.430
Carabona, I'd like you to help me.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:13.870
All right.

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:15.820
Will this do?

00:16:16.240 --> 00:16:17.540
You're doing great.

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:19.100
The ideas we're using are mostly yours.

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:21.700
This is all possible
because of your popularity.

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:27.910
Hey, who intercepted the Lift ship
communication and aired it to the ship?

00:16:28.480 --> 00:16:30.750
Everyone of us here is trying
to forget that incident.

00:16:31.650 --> 00:16:33.920
Bringing that subject up
now isn't going to help.

00:16:36.790 --> 00:16:38.120
Aw, what a drag.

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:39.350
Keep those legs moving!

00:16:39.660 --> 00:16:41.490
So that you can earn us points!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:43.860
Hey, I'm done.

00:16:43.860 --> 00:16:44.800
How'd it go?

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:49.800
Kinda lacks something! I was expecting
to get a bigger thrill from it.

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.240
That's how it usually turns out.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:55.110
Listen. Make sure you don't
give the ID number to anyone.

00:16:55.340 --> 00:16:56.430
I know.

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.730
Are you all right, Charlie?

00:16:59.210 --> 00:17:02.380
For you, Criff,
I'll always be all right. Oww...!

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:03.680
Charlie...

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:06.450
I wonder how your sister's doing.

00:17:07.550 --> 00:17:09.180
She's a strong girl, so...!

00:17:15.930 --> 00:17:18.800
<i>Did you really betray us, Blue?</i>

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.760
Sorry I'm late.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.600
Have a chance to calm down?

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:30.940
Yeah, somewhat.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.070
Morning. Are Aoi and the others well?

00:17:35.380 --> 00:17:36.250
Y-Yeah...

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:38.820
What do you want to see me about?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:40.510
I have a favor to ask.

00:17:41.420 --> 00:17:43.410
Could you please go to the Vital Guarder?

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:46.920
I'm not asking you to
operate it or anything.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:52.130
I need a relay person between the Ryvius
and the Vital Guarder, to act on my behalf.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.670
Since you're partners with Ikumi,
the main person...

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:58.400
...and your brother's also there,
I thought you'd be best suited to...!

00:17:58.400 --> 00:17:59.740
How come, all of a sudden?

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.030
Uh, well...!

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.280
I'll do it, If you're
okay with me doing it.

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:09.880
Thank you.

00:18:12.120 --> 00:18:13.950
Kouji. Wait, Kouji!

00:18:15.720 --> 00:18:16.710
Why?

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:18.190
Why, what?

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:20.990
You hated your brother so much.

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.550
I've been asked to do it,
so it can't be helped.

00:18:24.160 --> 00:18:26.890
It's not right.
You're not that kind of person.

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.030
I thought about what I
can do at this moment...

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:31.600
...just like you taught me.

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:33.310
That's all.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.670
<i>No. You're different.</i>

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.680
<i>You're a person with the</i>
<i>ability to part with your past.</i>

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.110
<i>You're just having trouble making up</i>
<i>your mind. That's it, right, Kouji?</i>

00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:22.090
<i>I feel lost. I can't understand</i>
<i>the position I'm in.</i>

00:19:23.120 --> 00:19:24.590
<i>Not even what direction</i>
<i>I should be headed.</i>

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.590
Kouji! Where are you going?

00:19:31.330 --> 00:19:32.570
To the Lift ship.

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:37.970
I was just thinking of delivering
food to Ikumi! Let's go together!

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:42.030
Hey, you! You've still got work left!

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:43.670
Be more responsible, will you?

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:47.280
Oh, sorry! You can go ahead
and deduct points from me.

00:19:47.380 --> 00:19:49.440
That's not the problem here!

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:52.580
I'll deliver it for you, Kozue. Okay?

00:19:52.990 --> 00:19:54.420
Huh? But...

00:19:55.120 --> 00:19:56.390
Keep them satisfied.

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:58.150
Y-Yeah, okay.

00:19:59.290 --> 00:20:00.190
See ya.

00:20:02.060 --> 00:20:03.330
Did you see that?

00:20:03.330 --> 00:20:05.090
She's all over the boys.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.760
Just because her boyfriend has unlimited
points, she can't just do as she wishes.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:11.030
She makes me so mad.

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.940
<i>You stand out too much.</i>
<i>Kozue, you idiot.</i>

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.480
Hey, wait a minute!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:18.600
I'll never, ever supervise again!

00:20:18.810 --> 00:20:19.800
It's not worth it!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:24.950
Look, we've only got these left.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:27.680
Are they really gonna
be able to supervise?

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.210
As if we have a choice.

00:20:31.190 --> 00:20:32.380
Excuse me.

00:20:32.860 --> 00:20:35.490
Is it true that supervisors
can eat all they want?

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:38.490
Please. At least come
with some clothes on.

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:48.240
Airs Blue...!

00:20:56.050 --> 00:20:59.310
As of today, I've been assigned
to ride the Vital Guarder.

00:20:59.990 --> 00:21:04.890
Level Two Navigator E-328456,
Kouji Aiba, 16 years old.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:07.250
Great to be here.

00:21:08.590 --> 00:21:12.360
I wanted power. I wanted revenge.

00:21:13.570 --> 00:21:15.860
Against my siblings who threw me out.

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.530
Against all those around me who
knew nothing but to order me around.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:22.730
But right now, everything's gone white.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.210
Shut up.

00:21:24.210 --> 00:21:26.300
There's only one thing left for me.

00:21:26.580 --> 00:21:27.580
Shut up!

00:21:27.580 --> 00:21:28.840
Juli Bahana.

00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:33.210
Get real! Is this supposed
to be some kind of joke?

00:21:33.850 --> 00:21:38.020
This is no joke. I've been
asked by our new captain, Juli.

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.790
Turn around and leave!

00:21:40.630 --> 00:21:41.790
Stop it!

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:43.280
I can't team up with my brother!

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:47.260
You're always wagging your tail
to those greater than you!

00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:50.830
Always swept along with whatever's
happening! You drive me nuts!

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.910
Say whatever you wish.

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.740
But let me make this clear.
I came here of my own free will.

00:21:57.940 --> 00:21:59.540
I came on my own free will.

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:04.550
<i>Even if it's regarded as escaping,</i>
<i>at least it's my own free will.</i>

00:22:07.640 --> 00:22:11.910
In your dry eyes...

00:22:11.910 --> 00:22:16.980
...a silhouette appears

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:21.690
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.690 --> 00:22:28.420
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.590 --> 00:22:37.830
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:46.440
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.440 --> 00:22:54.880
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:54.880 --> 00:22:58.790
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.790 --> 00:23:05.160
goodbye

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:10.920
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:11.160
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Free Order

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.520
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Free Order
There are those experiencing a decline.

00:23:12.520 --> 00:23:12.760
Next episode: Free Order

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:14.860
Next episode: Free Order
Those engulfed in greed.

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:17.630
Next episode: Free Order
The Ryvius is blanketed
in the order of freedom.

00:23:17.630 --> 00:23:19.830
Next episode: Free Order
I find myself proceeding towards an
invisible darkness called "tomorrow"...

00:23:19.830 --> 00:23:22.370
Next episode: Free Order
...while turning my face away.

00:23:22.370 --> 00:23:24.740
Next episode: Free Order
I don't care if there's nothing there.

00:23:24.740 --> 00:23:26.700
Next episode: Free Order
I don't care if we're not saved.

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:29.430
Next episode: Free Order
If there's nothing... that's fine by me!
